e, or temperature of fluids, and automatic regulators of electrical quantities designed to maintain desired values.\n\n[General Explanatory Notes Summary]\n- Incomplete or unfinished instruments (e.g. cameras without lenses) are classified as complete articles if they have the essential character of the finished goods. Parts of general use (fasteners, springs) and general-purpose items (wire, tubes) are strictly excluded from Chapter 90 parts."
